### Create new customer
POST http://localhost:4002/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jamielynn@yahoo.com",
  "password": "password",
  "firstName": "Jamie",
  "lastName": "Lynn",
  "phone": "0157595248586"
}

### Change role
POST http://localhost:4002/users/315459f2-7888-48e5-ab26-003733e93a4f/role/SHOP


### Keycloak debugging
GET http://localhost:4002/users/debug-keycloak

### Delete a user
DELETE http://localhost:4002/users/f8f54274-cf3b-4abe-9237-9ba60244f56d

### Delete all users
DELETE http://localhost:4002/users/reset-all
